## Setup

1. Clone the repository
```
   git clone https://github.com/ranautasmi99-cpu/VisionMatch-.git
   cd VisionMatch-
```

2. Create and activate a virtual environment
```
   python -m venv venv
   venv\Scripts\activate
```

3. Install the packages
```
   pip install -r requirements.txt
```

4. Create a MySQL database, then run the SQL in `migrations.sql` to create the tables.

5. Create a `.env` file in the main folder (see `.env.example`):
```
   GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
   DB_HOST=localhost
   DB_USER=your_user
   DB_PASSWORD=your_password
   DB_NAME=your_database
   SECRET_KEY=any_long_random_text
   MATCH_THRESHOLD=0.75
```

6. Run the app
```
   python app.py
```
   Then open the link shown in the terminal.

