## Security notes

- Passwords are stored as hashes, never as plain text.
- Only the two users in a chat can open it (checked on the server).
- Email and phone numbers are never shown publicly.
- Uploads are limited to jpg/png with a size limit.
- All SQL queries use parameter placeholders.


